VATE ACS Log Reader

The reader, tests, replay wrapper, storage example and self-authored synthetic
fixtures are provided under the Apache License 2.0 in LICENSE.

The supported capture shapes were examined using AngeYobo's published capture
in the OWASP Agent Control Standard discussion:
https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/agent-control-standard/issues/435
https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/agent-control-standard/issues/436
https://gist.github.com/AngeYobo/fe5cd44a864b4d54809cf1ded1e6d956/3ed175e24f4f4c5078aeddf5a0e301a4efd77aba

PUBLISHED-CAPTURE.json records references and raw hashes for that capture.
The original capture files and upstream tools are not redistributed here.
This folder's license does not relicense materials obtained from those links.

fixtures/synthetic contains invented data created for this reader's examples
and regression tests. It is not a copy of a host/Guardian execution capture.
